{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the domain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9c97071d2896ef1cea6f684b375fd34f505c52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\dfrac{x-2}{x^2+6x-16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"165\" height=\"40\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf0aba8f114598d032e95c8762edeb67354c5c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  \\{x\\mid x\\ne 8\\} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  \\{x\\mid x\\ne -2 \\text{ and } x\\ne 8\\} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  \\{x\\mid x\\ne 2 \\text{ and } x\\ne 8\\} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  \\{x\\mid x\\ne -2 \\text{ and } x\\ne -8\\} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  \\{x\\mid x\\ne 2 \\text{ and } x\\ne -8\\} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The function is <i>not</i> defined where the denominator is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f74fa8399336ee934815f2092fd4c7a3f478127.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 6x - 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> can be factored into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/7/0772cc8d4e465dffd9882a368969f7a9a6dab67b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 8)(x - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />, so this occurs at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bbfc6ff401ab655510610524e1fb71f747d6576.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -8$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />. Thus, the domain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/2/a12c4975b35fc435cf9db798caa400286f877627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } \\{x\\mid x\\ne 2 \\text{ and } x\\ne -8\\}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"230\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=20